{"idx": 12, "speaker": "雪菜", "type": "台词", "mood": "轻声", "text": "“呐，呐…以后，也可以，和你通电话吗？”", "start": 55.22, "dur": 3.71, "emotion": "中立", "emotion_score": 0.992, "hyp": "那,那,以后也可以,和你通电话吗?", "cer": 0.154, "sim_real": 0.392, "sim_anchor": 0.409, "near_anchor": "雪菜", "near_real": "雪菜", "f0": 326.5, "rate": 3.51, "jump": 1.26}
